{"3960370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "End Of Line", "steam_appid": 3960370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay alive in this first-person horror-puzzle game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped inside a claustrophobic train, each carriage tests you differently. Stay silent, outsmart monsters, and solve puzzles as you unravel its dark mysteries.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENVIRONMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire game takes place on a train where threats can appear at any moment. Each section of the train has its own distinct look and atmosphere. Because you can only move forward or backward through the carriages, there is no way to escape. You must rely on your wits to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960370/extras/8be32055e9ecab78b4ea84ce8a416221.poster.avif?t=1773313228\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960370/extras/8be32055e9ecab78b4ea84ce8a416221.webm?t=1773313228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960370/extras/8be32055e9ecab78b4ea84ce8a416221.mp4?t=1773313228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AVOID THE MONSTERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every carriage presents a different challenge. Sneak past threats, flee when necessary, or use clever tricks to distract monsters and create opportunities to move safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960370/extras/7d2ab18c15052dee16b7600d4c2488b2.poster.avif?t=1773313228\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960370/extras/7d2ab18c15052dee16b7600d4c2488b2.webm?t=1773313228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960370/extras/7d2ab18c15052dee16b7600d4c2488b2.mp4?t=1773313228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORYLINE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You do not know why you are here or what is happening. Notes left by previous passengers and mysterious train announcements gradually reveal the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960370/extras/ad02d965bea953811225d7ec8025373f.poster.avif?t=1773313228\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960370/extras/ad02d965bea953811225d7ec8025373f.webm?t=1773313228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960370/extras/ad02d965bea953811225d7ec8025373f.mp4?t=1773313228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have no weapons. Survival depends on using your surroundings and thinking carefully. Death is part of the journey. Experiment, face your fears, and discover how to overcome the challenges of the train.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960370/extras/3276f1f07b07362c32ab4d8e48027ac9.poster.avif?t=1773313228\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960370/extras/3276f1f07b07362c32ab4d8e48027ac9.webm?t=1773313228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960370/extras/3276f1f07b07362c32ab4d8e48027ac9.mp4?t=1773313228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay alive in this first-person horror-puzzle game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped inside a claustrophobic train, each carriage tests you differently. Stay silent, outsmart monsters, and solve puzzles as you unravel its dark mysteries.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENVIRONMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire game takes place on a train where threats can appear at any moment. Each section of the train has its own distinct look and atmosphere. Because you can only move forward or backward through the carriages, there is no way to escape. You must rely on your wits to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960370/extras/8be32055e9ecab78b4ea84ce8a416221.poster.avif?t=1773313228\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960370/extras/8be32055e9ecab78b4ea84ce8a416221.webm?t=1773313228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960370/extras/8be32055e9ecab78b4ea84ce8a416221.mp4?t=1773313228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AVOID THE MONSTERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every carriage presents a different challenge. Sneak past threats, flee when necessary, or use clever tricks to distract monsters and create opportunities to move safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960370/extras/7d2ab18c15052dee16b7600d4c2488b2.poster.avif?t=1773313228\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960370/extras/7d2ab18c15052dee16b7600d4c2488b2.webm?t=1773313228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960370/extras/7d2ab18c15052dee16b7600d4c2488b2.mp4?t=1773313228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORYLINE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You do not know why you are here or what is happening. Notes left by previous passengers and mysterious train announcements gradually reveal the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960370/extras/ad02d965bea953811225d7ec8025373f.poster.avif?t=1773313228\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960370/extras/ad02d965bea953811225d7ec8025373f.webm?t=1773313228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960370/extras/ad02d965bea953811225d7ec8025373f.mp4?t=1773313228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have no weapons. Survival depends on using your surroundings and thinking carefully. Death is part of the journey. Experiment, face your fears, and discover how to overcome the challenges of the train.</p